  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n200% of k - (k + 2)% of 50 = k\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA% of B = (A/100) × B\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 200% of k - (k + 2)% of 50 = k\n\n⇒ (200/100) × k - (k + 2)/100 × 50 = k\n\n⇒ 2k - 0.5(k + 2) = k\n\n⇒ 2k - 0.5k - 1 = k\n\n⇒ 1.5k - 1 = k\n\n⇒ 1.5k - k = 1\n\n⇒ 0.5k = 1\n\n⇒ k = 1/0.5 = 2",
